{%- doc -%}
  The line that tells a shopper a first-order discount exists, next to the
  discount field in both carts.

  It does NOT print the code. The code is the reward for joining the list, and a
  code sitting in the cart for everyone to read is a code nobody has to join for
  — so this points at the way in and lets the signup hand it over, on the home
  page's "משפחת LUXAMOM" section or in the popup.

  The discount itself is the live 10%-off, once-per-customer code in the admin,
  handed out by luxamom-club and luxamom-popup.
{%- enddoc -%}

<p class="lxm-cart-code-hint">
  אין לך קוד? <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#club">מצטרפות לרשימת התפוצה</a>
  ומקבלות <b>10% הנחה על ההזמנה הראשונה</b> — הקוד מופיע מיד עם ההרשמה.
</p>
